{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dead World is a first-person shooter game created by a single person which is set in a post-apocalyptic Argentina that is divided into several stories in different times and locations of the country.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story 1: THE LOST WAGON</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set 30 years after the war in Rosario, Santa Fe </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story 2: GINO'S JOURNEY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set 12 years after the war in the volcanic dunes of La Payunia, Mendoza</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MAIN FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Diversity:</strong> Experience different narratives that explore the diverse facets of the Dead World.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Exploration:</strong> Traverse detailed environments in search of resources vital to your survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Combat:</strong> Face off against mutants and bandits using a wide variety of weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelite Mode:</strong> Test your skills in &quot;A Rogue's Tale,&quot; where survival depends on your decisions and skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> 1VS1 Mode: </strong>Face another player in 1VS1 mode and prove to be the most badass in the dead world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in Dead World and see if you can survive in a world where every step could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Developed by a single person</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dead World is a project made with love and a lot of hard work. If you like what you see, your support helps me continue creating.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sincerely, Juani from <strong>Milanesa Studio</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The lost wagon Act 1","